{"mode":"words","text":"Nyt kuuntelet tekstiä ja luet sitä samalla. Aloittelijana luet merkitysrivin äidinkielelläsi, kuuntelet kohdekieltä hitaasti ja painat usein taukopainiketta — näin mielesi yhdistää äänen merkitykseen. Edistyneenä lukijana luet alkuperäistä tekstiä ja katsot vain tuntemattomien sanojen kohdalla lyhyesti alas. Käytä tässä usein A-B-toistoa: merkitse yksi lause ja toista sitä silmukassa — kokeile sitä yllä.","words":[{"s":0,"e":290},{"s":360,"e":848},{"s":894,"e":1393},{"s":1428,"e":1486},{"s":1533,"e":1776},{"s":1823,"e":2043},{"s":2113,"e":2833},{"s":3785,"e":4551},{"s":4598,"e":4841},{"s":4911,"e":5782},{"s":5863,"e":6954},{"s":7105,"e":7581},{"s":7651,"e":8359},{"s":8429,"e":9056},{"s":9149,"e":9265},{"s":9323,"e":9625},{"s":9694,"e":9985},{"s":10031,"e":11076},{"s":11100,"e":11158},{"s":11309,"e":11518},{"s":11587,"e":11982},{"s":12040,"e":12574},{"s":12644,"e":12992},{"s":13062,"e":14037},{"s":14733,"e":15442},{"s":15488,"e":15953},{"s":15999,"e":16220},{"s":16289,"e":16939},{"s":16997,"e":17555},{"s":17706,"e":17810},{"s":17868,"e":18216},{"s":18263,"e":18414},{"s":18460,"e":19285},{"s":19343,"e":19714},{"s":19772,"e":20155},{"s":20213,"e":20736},{"s":20817,"e":21386},{"s":21990,"e":22257},{"s":22350,"e":22617},{"s":22675,"e":22965},{"s":23058,"e":24114},{"s":24323,"e":24788},{"s":24857,"e":25171},{"s":25229,"e":25682},{"s":25798,"e":25879},{"s":25937,"e":26239},{"s":26285,"e":26494},{"s":26552,"e":27295},{"s":27342,"e":27388},{"s":27435,"e":27853},{"s":27899,"e":28178},{"s":28259,"e":28979}]}